        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "An open-world action/adventure game in which a young wanderer, along with a stolen magical sword and his steed companion, trespasses a cursed land, makes a deal with an ancient being to bring a sacrificial victim back to life, and sets off to fulfill his end of the bargain, which involves tracking down and infiltrating the abodes of sixteen colossi and sacrificing them to achieve his goal.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un juego de acción y aventura de mundo abierto en el que un joven errante, junto con una espada mágica robada y su montura, se adentra sin permiso en una tierra maldita, hace un pacto con un ser antiguo para devolver a la vida a una víctima sacrificial, y se pone en marcha para cumplir su parte del trato, que implica rastrear e infiltrarse en las moradas de dieciséis colosos y sacrificarlos para lograr su objetivo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2005",
