        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "An action-adventure game in which a boy is abandoned and taken to a massive castle by his people. After exploring it for a while, he meets a girl who speaks a different language than him, then decides to get both of them out of the castle grounds by leading her along, in order to escape the shadow-like creatures that frequently try to kidnap the girl.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un juego de acción y aventura en el que un niño es abandonado y llevado a un enorme castillo por su gente. Tras explorarlo durante un rato, conoce a una niña que habla un idioma distinto al suyo y decide sacar a ambos de los terrenos del castillo, llevándola consigo, para escapar de las criaturas con forma de sombra que con frecuencia intentan secuestrarla.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
